 "). It is used here inside a ",
 StyleBox["Module",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 ", on a local variable: the stage itself is still built once and never \
